    "All 96 remain in each denominator, including missing retrieved pages, invalid output, refusals, generation/budget failures and unrun rows. No post-output question selection.",
    "Question-stated conditions may be inherited. Necessary source measurement conditions and quantity/subject/component binding must be preserved. Apply the previously frozen four-question footnote clarification, without changing reference values.",
    "Extra unsupported or wrongly bound assertions affect correctness/support. Citation membership alone is insufficient: citations must support the answer assertions.",
    "Format compliance is a separate diagnostic. Clearly identifiable answers/citations in fenced JSON or other recoverable presentation receive semantic review; malformed syntax alone is not a semantic error. Missing or unidentifiable answer/citations cannot pass joint_correct.",
    "Absence from retrieved evidence is not real-world unknown. Do not use facts visible only in the reference to mark supplied-evidence support true.",
    "Quantity form, unit, subject/component and condition binding errors are question-level flags; multiple errors in one question count once.",
    "The old 31000-token format probe had an empty citation list: retain as observed development limitation; do not amend prompt or generation settings."
